<title>PHILIPPINES: C&amp;P Homes, HI set div record dates.</title>
<headline>C&amp;P Homes, HI set div record dates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine low-cost housing developer C&amp;P Homes Inc said on Wednesday its 50 percent stock dividend will cover stockholders on record as of October 18. The stock dividend was approved by the board of directors last March 11.</p>
<p>Holding firm House of Investments Inc also set the record date for its 100 percent stock dividend on October 9. The dividend was declared last June 11.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
